# Hireoven cron entries — for the WEB box (powerful-platypus, 4 GB, us-east).
#
# This box should run NO heavy crons. It only serves the public site + Postgres
# + MinIO. Running the crawl/enrichment here is what overloaded its 4 GB RAM and
# caused intermittent 502s. All batch crons now run on the HARVESTER box against
# a private worker — see scripts/hetzner-crontab-worker.example.
#
# => The web box crontab should be EMPTY. If you previously pasted the full
#    schedule here, run `crontab -e` and delete it (after the worker crontab on
#    the harvester box is confirmed running).
#
# Nothing below this line. Keep it that way.
